 ## Background
-This method is derived from the implementation details of 3D Gaussian Splatting, specifically the batched alpha computation step used in rasterization. The specific implementation details, including the clamping and thresholding values, are taken from an unofficial repository [S1, unofficial]. The approach leverages the vectorization capabilities of deep learning frameworks like PyTorch to perform the rasterization efficiently [G].
